Package: designr
Type: Package
Title: Unified Interface for Phase 3 Clinical Trial Design
Version: 0.0.0.9001
Authors@R: person(given = "Wei", family = "Fu", email = "wei.ai.lab@outlook.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Author: Wei Fu [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Wei Fu <wei.ai.lab@outlook.com>
Description: A consistent, well-documented R interface over established clinical
    trial design packages (gsDesign, gsDesign2, rpact, simtrial, and others),
    designed to be called from an MCP server so that LLM-based assistants can
    reliably produce correct Phase 3 designs. Supports fixed-sample, group-
    sequential, adaptive, multi-arm multi-stage, time-to-event, Bayesian, and
    master-protocol (platform/basket/umbrella) designs.
License: Apache License (>= 2)
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    gsDesign,
    gsDesign2,
    jsonlite
Suggests:
    rpact,
    simtrial,
    testthat (>= 3.0.0),
    yaml
Config/testthat/edition: 3
RoxygenNote: 7.3.3
URL: https://github.com/wei-ai-lab/designr
BugReports: https://github.com/wei-ai-lab/designr/issues
